# The locale a program runs under: language and region subtags, the full tag, and the time zone. `environment`'s
# `locale` reads it and `locales` lists the ones the platform knows; this file holds the form both use, so the
# natives can build it without importing the module that delegates to them.

mark unstable

form locale
  link language, like text
  link region, like text
  link tag, like text
  link timezone, like text
